    {"id":"te211623012846","type":"text","x":825.89,"y":1512.5,"width":148.22,"height":14,"strokeColor":"#007aff","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":0,"index":"b6q","text":"Look for your names again","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"ar305529312212","lineHeight":1.25},
    {"id":"te773348484242","type":"text","x":60,"y":2260,"width":1121.8,"height":13.75,"strokeColor":"#767a85","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":0,"index":"b6r","text":"Design document, not screenshots: screens are drawn in the app's iOS idiom, and alerts as the apps draw them. Tags compare with phase 2 (simplex-names-flow-phase2.svg): as phase 2, changed, new.","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"id":"te531133686807","type":"text","x":60,"y":2275,"width":1225.67,"height":13.75,"strokeColor":"#767a85","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":0,"index":"b6s","text":"The key is the device wallet of the wallet-keys RFC (simplex-chat#7475): one BIP-39 master per device, 24 words, no passphrase, one account per name. Phase 2 drew 12 or 24 words and a picker of several keys; both go.","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"id":"te889258929370","type":"text","x":60,"y":2290,"width":539.39,"height":13.75,"strokeColor":"#767a85","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":0,"index":"b6t","text":"Not drawn: a name managed elsewhere, as phase 2; exporting one name's key; deleting the key.","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":2,"lineHeight":1.25},
